{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FREE BUILDING</h2>Any block in your anthill can be dug up and built upon at your discretion. Maintain a balance between convenient ant movement and keeping important buildings inaccessible to enemy raids!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1238190/extras/0dbd65079b712be79ba1dd95777811f3.poster.avif?t=1758554737\" width=600 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1238190/extras/0dbd65079b712be79ba1dd95777811f3.webm?t=1758554737\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1238190/extras/0dbd65079b712be79ba1dd95777811f3.mp4?t=1758554737\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UNLIMITED NUMBER OF UNITS</h2>We have no limit on ants. Build as large colony as you can sustain!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1238190/extras/f56d041381e2f1d4d169fb7cad3da245.poster.avif?t=1758554737\" width=600 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1238190/extras/f56d041381e2f1d4d169fb7cad3da245.webm?t=1758554737\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1238190/extras/f56d041381e2f1d4d169fb7cad3da245.mp4?t=1758554737\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MANY TOUGH OPPONENTS</h2>80+ different enemies from all corners of the planet<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1238190/extras/5b8b16d1f12891acecfdde866b7db5a8.poster.avif?t=1758554737\" width=600 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1238190/extras/5b8b16d1f12891acecfdde866b7db5a8.webm?t=1758554737\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1238190/extras/5b8b16d1f12891acecfdde866b7db5a8.mp4?t=1758554737\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MAKE YOUR OWN BUILD</h2>The game features many different types of ants with various abilities - queens, scouts, loaders, farmers, tanks, warriors... In combination, you can assemble almost any real-life species of ants.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1238190/extras/1eee4dfc46b132d99698ac5b7ea2fe2f.avif?t=1758554737\" width=600 height=226 /></span>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1238190?t=1758554737","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1238190/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758554737","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1238190/a4be6faefc83563dbc4a82ccb0fb949bc9ce9b80/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758554737","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1238190/a4be6faefc83563dbc4a82ccb0fb949bc9ce9b80/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758554737","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FREE BUILDING</h2>Any block in your anthill can be dug up and built upon at your discretion. Maintain a balanc